  {
   "id": "2qbYOgx-AQAJ",
   "from": "dave.a...@colby.edu",
   "author": "8f308306a17e05c6",
   "date": "2017-06-07T17:47:06Z",
   "subject": "Are pairwise p-values from advanced.procD.lm adjusted?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I was curious is the pairwise p-values generated by geomorph::advanced.procD.lm are adjusted for FWER, and if so by what method?</div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "oCpDbgpcCQAJ",
   "from": "Adams, Dean [EEOBS]",
   "author": "4d71c6e24fb21497",
   "date": "2017-06-07T20:13:53Z",
   "subject": "RE: [geomorph-r-package] Are pairwise p-values from advanced.procD.lm adjusted?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_6570866011607050431__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">No, the pairwise comparisons are not pre-adjusted by any experiment-wise error rate. They represent the actual observed probability\r\n of the pairwise comparison relative to the distribution of outcomes from permutation. Any such adjustment is a decision left for the individual user, and should be performed in a post-hoc manner following the actual assessment of significance.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Thus, if one wishes to compare the observed pairwise significance to the nominal alpha  = 0.05, or the Bonferroni-adjusted value (alpha/k-comparisons), or the\r\n Dunn-Sidak value, or sequential Bonferroni, or otherwise, they may do so accordingly. Note that this post-hoc approach is, in fact, consistent with proper statistical theory (though not always practice in some circles).  Statistically speaking, such adjustments\r\n should always be considered an adjustment of the comparison alpha, not an adjustment to the observed probability value.\r\n<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">       Department of Statistics</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486154387000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lDwOmNsA3p0yzGogX2Ykf\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+151